<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's statistics body launches Internet page.</title>
<headline>Portugal's statistics body launches Internet page.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute (INE) said it was launching a service on the Internet which would allow its statistical publications to be consulted at a small cost.</p>
<p>The service could be consulted on http://www.ine.pt.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
